security.c tests access requests with S_IREAD, S_IWRITE and S_IEXEC, the
old names of the owner permission bits.  The LikeOS <sys/stat.h> has only
the POSIX names (S_IRUSR, S_IWUSR, S_IXUSR), which are the same values; the
old names are defined from them where the libc does not have them.

